                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. Only an affected employee or AFSCME on behalf of the affected employee can raise a pay equity grievance. Pay equity must be defined in accordance with the provisions in Section C.2, above. An affected employee may only raise a pay equity grievance pertaining to his or her current classification.",
            "block_bbox": [
                252,
                207,
                1122,
                348
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    252.0,
                    207.0
                ],
                [
                    1122.0,
                    207.0
                ],
                [
                    1122.0,
                    348.0
                ],
                [
                    252.0,
                    348.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. At all steps of the grievance and arbitration procedure, the remedy is limited to whether the University properly applied the criteria in Section C. 2. The arbitrator shall have no authority to set individual wage rates that are less than 5% different from the wages of the comparator new employee.",
            "block_bbox": [
                252,
                373,
                1121,
                513
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    252.0,
                    373.0
                ],
                [
                    1121.0,
                    373.0
                ],
                [
                    1121.0,
                    513.0
                ],
                [
                    252.0,
                    513.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "2. Normal Procedure for adjusting pay equities existing from January 28, 2002",
            "block_bbox": [
                188,
                539,
                1089,
                569
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    188.0,
